Le rituel : utilisez le gel micro-peeling pour nettoyer la peau, puis appliquez le sérum sur le visage, le cou et le décolleté. Suivez les instructions figurant sur chaque produit.',59900,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/Artboard1-08.png?v=1793444695',10,1,'8642353168559','47238469058735','https://beautymarket.ma/products/la-roche-posay-routine-anti-taches-mela-b3-cleanser-200ml-mela-b3-serum-30ml-anthelios-anti-taches-spf-50-15ml-offert',1,'["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/Artboard1-08.png?v=1793444695","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/1_5bfa951c-c358-44b6-a919-2ddc3a3bd221.png?v=1793446560","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/2_a1baee88-e94d-422b-9ce1-b79932170346.png?v=1793446560","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/5_75b9af53-ef45-4e61-a16b-dd253ff5eaea.png?v=1793446560","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/4_b6825e63-0c39-4bc4-9d96-30c396574d7a.png?v=1793446560","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/3_b037f2e9-86ac-4cf3-b081-317119c95d68.png?v=1793446559"]',NULL) ON CONFLICT(source_variant_id) DO NOTHING;
