Application après application, le shampooing anti-chute permet aux cheveux de retrouver de la vigueur et de la vitalité.

89 % des personnes trouvent leurs cheveux plus forts

90 % des personnes trouvent leurs cheveux plus toniques',12500,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/WhatsAppImage2026-09-10at14.47.10_3.jpg?v=1789387911',10,1,'8699763196079','47512530157743','https://beautymarket.ma/products/vichy-dercos-pack-shampooing-energisant-anti-chute-200-ml-format-voyage-50-ml-offert',1,'["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/WhatsAppImage2026-09-10at14.47.10_3.jpg?v=1789387911","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/dercos200ML.jpg?v=1766156462","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/PackshotTexture_0d392fd3-897d-4be4-944f-96b1e8e5692c.jpg?v=1766156462","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/PackshotBack_7bb8cbb4-1f1f-4fd2-94e3-73155a1a83ab.jpg?v=1766156462","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/Ingredients_347e3f37-5cba-4903-9d51-d40ed663eb65.jpg?v=1766156462","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/ClinicalResults_f781144c-0e6a-4fcb-96a9-974754dbbaeb.jpg?v=1766156462","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/Howtouse.jpg?v=1766156462","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/noText.jpg?v=1766156462","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/Routine_7cfdd727-dabb-4d7f-8af1-0b050c940a62.jpg?v=1766156462","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/Comparison.jpg?v=1766156462","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/Texture_febcc861-42ae-4e35-aeed-54c466cbfc4f.jpg?v=1766156462","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/Proendorsement_7ad39777-681f-4d6f-8925-be55819ea2fb.jpg?v=1766156462"]',NULL) ON CONFLICT(source_variant_id) DO NOTHING;
